Once upon a time, there was a smooth stone. It stood in a row near a big tree. The stone wanted to be just like the other stones.
One day, a little girl found the smooth stone. She saw the shiny stone and said, "Wow! This stone is so pretty. I will buy it for you." The girl took the stone home.
At home, the girl put the stone in a small bowl. She decided to pour water on the shiny stone. Soon, the smooth stone drank the water from the row. The stone was happy and so was the girl. They became friends and lived happily ever after.
